{
    "background_story": "Faith was a dedicated and compassionate nurse specializing in parenteral nutrition. She worked in the ICU, where she cared for patients who required intravenous feeding due to various medical conditions. Faith took great pride in her work, ensuring that each patient received the precise amount of nutrients needed to aid in their recovery. Her attention to detail and gentle touch put even the most anxious patients at ease. One patient, a young mother named Sarah, was particularly grateful for Faith's care. Sarah's newborn baby required parenteral nutrition, and Faith went above and beyond to educate her on the process, alleviating her fears and worries. Thanks to Faith's expertise and kindness, Sarah's baby thrived, and she was forever grateful for the nurse's selfless dedication.",
